      "description": "Read the exact-date 09:25:20 final opening-auction series batch by six-digit codes; no earlier-round or legacy-table fallback. Quantities retain their business meaning and certified units; missing/unverified values are null, explicit zero is zero. Inspect quantity_quality; 100 stock shares means 100 shares, not 100 lots.",
